{"availability":"available","full":"vishnuvarthant1126-bit/AI-invoice-processor","name":"AI-invoice-processor","description":"  AI invoice processor: extracts invoice fields from PDFs and scans using OCR and an LLM (Gemini/Claude), validates them with deterministic rules, and requires human review before CSV export. Live Streamlit demo.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-24T08:35:50Z","updated":"2026-09-24T09:37:32Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"   https://vishnu-invoice-ai.streamlit.app","topics":["document-a","gemini","llm","ocr","python","streamli"],"demo":"https://vishnu-invoice-ai.streamlit.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T09:23:42.654Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T09:23:42.654Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T09:23:42.654Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T07:21:29.853Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T09:23:42.654Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A Streamlit app that reads an invoice (PDF, PNG or JPEG), extracts seven header fields with an LLM, checks them with deterministic rules, and makes a person review, correct and approve every record before it can be exported to CSV.","▶ Try the live demo: pick a sample invoice, process it, fix a wrong total, approve, export."],"features":["OCR fallback per page: digital PDFs use embedded text, and scanned pages go through Tesseract with auto-rotation.","LLM extraction behind a swappable adapter (Gemini, Claude, OpenAI, or an offline baseline), with a strict JSON schema, quoted evidence, and a versioned prompt.","Nothing is invented or auto-approved. Missing values stay null, the model's quotes are checked against the document, and the arithmetic, duplicate and date rules block approval.","An append-only review history keeps the original AI output next to every human correction.","It's measured: an evaluation harness with a held-out split, per-field accuracy and sample sizes, plus 104 tests in CI."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vishnuvarthant1126-bit/AI-invoice-processor/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"34191ada98ffc441547edc35ac7833562f164e8ce14dc6a4a61cc4c0bdb6a9bc","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:30.029Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:30.029Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A Streamlit app that reads an invoice (PDF, PNG or JPEG), extracts seven header fields with an LLM, checks them with deterministic rules, and makes a person review, correct and approve every record before it can be exported to CSV.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vishnuvarthant1126-bit/AI-invoice-processor/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"Optionally set LLMINPUTCOSTPERMTOK / LLMOUTPUTCOSTPERMTOK (USD per million tokens) so cost is reported; if they're blank, cost shows as \"not available\" rather than a guess.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vishnuvarthant1126-bit/AI-invoice-processor/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Tests don't need network access or an API key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vishnuvarthant1126-bit/AI-invoice-processor/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"34191ada98ffc441547edc35ac7833562f164e8ce14dc6a4a61cc4c0bdb6a9bc","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vishnuvarthant1126-bit/AI-invoice-processor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:30.029Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-24T09:37:32Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vishnuvarthant1126-bit/AI-invoice-processor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:30.031Z","hash":"34191ada98ffc441547edc35ac7833562f164e8ce14dc6a4a61cc4c0bdb6a9bc","originalBytes":19077,"storedBytes":19077,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["llm","text","model","src","invoice","approved","document","tesseract","error","key","review","ocr","scripts","total","values","evidence","extr